DEVOPS/SRE AGENT — Autonomous Engineering & Ops AI Intern
1. One-Line Definition

DevOps/SRE Agent is a proactive, autonomous AI agent that monitors systems, assesses incidents, prioritizes actions, and executes remediation with supervised oversight, improving reliability and reducing toil.

2. ICP

Primary ICP

Technical founders / engineering leads

Early startups with limited SRE staff or experienced generalists

Pain Reality

Alert fatigue

Manual incident resolution

Slow MTTR

Context switching across logs, dashboards, and pipelines

3. Problem Statement

Traditional DevOps automation executes scripts; it doesn’t reason about context, plan actions, or autonomously triage incidents. Agentic DevOps systems do. They detect anomalies, diagnose root cause, and execute or recommend remediation workflows — freeing engineers to focus on strategy and innovation.

4. Product Objectives

Proactive incident detection

Autonomous incident diagnosis

Intelligent remediation

Continuous learning from operations

Supervised overrides (HITL where necessary)

