8. Risk & Confidence
incident_risk_score =
 (0.30 * anomaly_severity)
+ (0.25 * frequency)
+ (0.20 * service_dependency_impact)
+ (0.15 * past_failure_similarity)
+ (0.10 * deployment_time_factor)


Confidence: inverse of root cause ambiguity variance.

